Line":216,"endLineOffset":30,"length":23},{"pos":10358,"endPos":10388,"startLine":217,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":217,"endLineOffset":38,"length":31},{"pos":10389,"endPos":10413,"startLine":217,"startLineOffset":39,"endLine":217,"endLineOffset":63,"length":25},{"pos":10423,"endPos":10458,"startLine":219,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":219,"endLineOffset":43,"length":36},{"pos":10467,"endPos":10774,"startLine":220,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":226,"endLineOffset":9,"length":308},{"pos":10784,"endPos":10813,"startLine":228,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":228,"endLineOffset":37,"length":30},{"pos":10822,"endPos":10845,"startLine":229,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":229,"endLineOffset":31,"length":24},{"pos":10854,"endPos":10875,"startLine":230,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":230,"endLineOffset":29,"length":22},{"pos":10885,"endPos":10946,"startLine":232,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":232,"endLineOffset":69,"length":62},{"pos":10955,"endPos":11013,"startLine":233,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":233,"endLineOffset":66,"length":59}]}]}]},{"groundTruth":{"original_line":72,"line":72,"comment_lines":["[][72]"],"review_comment":["Could you point me at the code where this happens? And is it the case that starting the shard snapshots AFTER finishing uploading files won\u0027t be noop shard snapshots?\r\n\r\nI\u0027m mostly thinking about the cases where later snapshots complete shard snapshots even if the older snapshots aren\u0027t done. It\u0027d be nice to know for sure that those later ones aren\u0027t ever doing work.","\u003e Could you point me at the code where this happens?\r\n\r\nWhat happens exactly? The code that prefers to start new shard snapshots over uploading files is the line that sorts by `SnapshotTask::priority`.\r\n\r\n\u003e I\u0027m mostly thinking about the cases where later snapshots complete shard snapshots even if the older snapshots aren\u0027t done. It\u0027d be nice to know for sure that those later ones aren\u0027t ever doing work.\r\n\r\nI mean they could be doing work occasionally, if e.g. there are 10 threads and 9 of them are doing the last 9 tasks for an older snapshot, the free thread will start on the next task in the queue for the newer snapshot.","Sorry, I was burying the purpose of my questions. The point I was trying to get at is whether prioritizing new shard snapshots is best, instead of prioritizing file uploads and the completion of existing shard snapshots.","It doesn\u0027t seem obvious that the next snapshot of a shard will be a noop, whenever it gets scheduled, sooner vs later, because it could already have been a while since the first snapshot of that shard started.","I wonder if it would be better to prioritize finishing file uploads of existing shard snapshots. Focus on getting one good overall snapshot, not spreading resources out to other snapshots.","Yeah that\u0027s ok, we run one task to start the shard snapshot but then all its file upload tasks get queued up behind other earlier shards\u0027 work.","\u003e I wonder if it would be better to prioritize finishing file uploads of existing shard snapshots.\r\n\r\nAFAICT it doesn\u0027t matter, or at least there are fairly balanced pros and cons either way. The `ShardSnapshotTask` tasks are much more lightweight than the `FileSnapshotTask` ones so they don\u0027t meaningfully add to the WIP we\u0027re interested in limiting in this PR; meanwhile it\u0027ll save work overall to run them sooner.","It could be thousands of shards in a new snapshot request that we prioritize starting up instead of running file uploads for an older snapshot.\r\n\r\nWe don\u0027t have any stats on this edge case, though, and the behavior in unchanged by this patch, so seems fine to go forward with 👍 "],"path":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/repositories/blobstore/ShardSnapshotTaskRunner.java","id":36197,"created_at":"2024-08-05T15:21:12Z","original_position":49,"side":"RIGHT","position":49,"submitted_on_commit":"99699031832005cf6202c3ddadb299bf38cc244e","diff_hunk":"@@ -38,23 +39,41 @@ public class ShardSnapshotTaskRunner {\n     private final CheckedBiConsumer\u003cSnapshotShardContext, FileInfo, IOException\u003e fileSnapshotter;\n \n     abstract static class SnapshotTask extends AbstractRunnable implements Comparable\u003cSnapshotTask\u003e {\n-\n-        private static final Comparator\u003cSnapshotTask\u003e COMPARATOR \u003d Comparator.comparingLong(\n-            (SnapshotTask t) -\u003e t.context().snapshotStartTime()\n-        ).thenComparing(t -\u003e t.context().snapshotId().getUUID()).thenComparingInt(SnapshotTask::priority);\n-\n         protected final SnapshotShardContext context;\n \n         SnapshotTask(SnapshotShardContext context) {\n             this.context \u003d context;\n         }\n \n+        public final SnapshotShardContext context() {\n+            return context;\n+        }\n+\n+        private long getSnapshotStartTime() {\n+            return context().snapshotStartTime();\n+        }\n+\n+        private String snapshotUUID() {\n+            return context().snapshotId().getUUID();\n+        }\n+\n         public abstract int priority();\n \n-        public SnapshotShardContext context() {\n-            return context;\n+        @SuppressWarnings(\"resource\")\n+        private ShardId shardId() {\n+            return context().store().shardId();\n         }\n \n+        private static final Comparator\u003cSnapshotTask\u003e COMPARATOR \u003d Comparator\n+            // Prefer work from the oldest running snapshot ...\n+            .comparingLong(SnapshotTask::getSnapshotStartTime)\n+            // ... tiebreaking on UUID just in case two of them start at the same millisecond ...\n+            .thenComparing(SnapshotTask::snapshotUUID)\n+            // ... then prefer starting new shard snapshots over uploading files for ongoing ones (for fast noop shard snapshots) ...","submitted_line":72},"generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The refactoring of the `COMPARATOR` is clear and improves readability. The comments added explain the sorting criteria well, which is helpful for understanding the logic.","nodes":[{"id":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/repositories/blobstore/ShardSnapshotTaskRunner.java-server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/repositories/blobstore/ShardSnapshotTaskRunner.java-1898:2153-2576:3296","promptId":"#24JCQ","srcPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/repositories/blobstore/ShardSnapshotTaskRunner.java","dstPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/repositories/blobstore/ShardSnapshotTaskRunner.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":1898,"endPos":2153,"startLine":42,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":44,"endLineOffset":106,"length":256}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":2576,"endPos":3296,"startLine":67,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":75,"endLineOffset":50,"length":721}]}]}]}],"coveredGroundTruth":2,"uncoveredGroundTruth":0,"coveredMatchable":8,"uncoveredMatchable":1,"timing":20127,"tokensIn":4541,"tokensOut":606}